    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταφύομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, c. aor. 2
		
			Act.
		 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έφῡν</span>: pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέφῡκα</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>become by change</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖοι μετέφυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					108.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. Hierocl <i><span class="en">
				<u>in CA</u>
				20p.462M.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν ὅσοι δειλοὶ [ἦσαν] γυναῖκες
					μετεφύοντο ἐν τῇ δευτέρα γενέσει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					90e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὔφορβος γεγονέναι μεταφῦναί τε Ἴων
					ἐκ Τρωός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>grow after</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μεταφύντες</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντες</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Carn.</u>
				12
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύοντες</span> codd.,
			v. l. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυέοντες</span>, fort.
				-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυέντες</span>).</div>
